web search: 'Type 1 configuration'
codex
The decode masks agree with the independent PCI layout, and the registered window bounds keep `tag` nonnegative. The test coverage has two clear gaps: no type-0 configuration write, and no type-1 read to a nonzero bus. Also, `alive2` only means the PTY stayed open until a timeout; it does not confirm that the alias access completed.
